      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Heron Wood – Boutique New Homes in Cabinteely Village\r\n\r\nHeron Wood is an exclusive new residential development launching this spring in the heart of Cabinteely Village, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nThis privately gated development comprises just 34 beautifully designed homes, offering a rare opportunity to purchase a new home in one of south Dublin’s most desirable and well-established neighbourhoods. Developed by Durkan Residential BMS Ltd and designed by McCullough Mulvin Architects, Heron Wood combines contemporary architecture with enduring quality.\r\n\r\nBuilt to Passive House standards, these homes are designed to deliver exceptional energy efficiency, comfort, and sustainability. The development will feature a thoughtfully planned mix of apartments, duplexes, and houses, all set within a high-quality residential environment.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in Cabinteely Village, Heron Wood offers immediate access to local shops, cafés, schools, and everyday amenities, along with excellent transport links to the wider south Dublin area.\r\n\r\nFor further information, visit heronwood.ie or contact Savills on 01 618 1300."
      },
